{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21281","headline":"顺宗至德大圣大安孝皇帝挽歌词三首 一 · 元稹","name":"顺宗至德大圣大安孝皇帝挽歌词三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不改延洪祚，因成揖让朝。\n讴歌同戴啓，遏密共思尧。\n雨露施恩广，梯航会葬遥。\n号弓那独切，曾感昔年招。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21281.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21281","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}